/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For all the problems mentioned previosly, We now know the solutions which I would like to list, The main problem was to develop such sytem which integrates all the known solutions . Monarch was such a result of all such decisions made to overcome those problems)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
