<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Fault Tolerance: Simple solution for this is to maintain replicas which is indeed done in Monarch. Also to improve performance we maintain each replica to a different level of granularity \(detailing\). )
/E (Fault Tolerance: Simple solution for this is to maintain replicas which is indeed done in Monarch. Also to improve performance we maintain each replica to a different level of granularity \(detailing\). )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
