/T (Storage Issue: With petabytes of data needed to be stored we need to introduce some sort of compression or new data structures to hold data effectively and in cheapest possible manner. For some encoding techniques were used which serve the purpose.)
/E (Storage Issue: With petabytes of data needed to be stored we need to introduce some sort of compression or new data structures to hold data effectively and in cheapest possible manner. For some encoding techniques were used which serve the purpose.)
